{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02368","headline":"杂歌谣辞 黄昙子歌 · 温庭筠","name":"杂歌谣辞 黄昙子歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"参差绿蒲短，摇艳云塘满。\n红潋荡融融，莺翁鸂鶒暖。\n萋芊小城路，马上修蛾懒。\n罗衫褭向风，点粉金鹂卵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02368.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02368","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}